cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PeerReviewAgents"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent LLM peer-review framework that simulates a journal editorial
  board — eight specialist reviewers, an advocate/skeptic debate, an area-chair
  synthesis, an author rebuttal, and an editor-in-chief verdict — to produce an
  accept / minor / major / reject recommendation on a manuscript, with full
  reports at every stage.
type: software
